{"id":"615216","name":"蔬菜松茸烩饭","author":"seiseizhang","authorId":"2304656","desc":"","cover":"images/615216/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"4-5人量"}],"sub":[{"name":"赤松茸","amount":"3个"},{"name":"羽衣甘蓝","amount":"100g"},{"name":"松子仁","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"羽衣甘蓝洗净，去掉硬杆。","img":"images/615216/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切碎一些。","img":"images/615216/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"赤松茸洗净，去蒂。","img":"images/615216/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切薄片。","img":"images/615216/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"准备好15g黄油和一小把熟松子仁。","img":"images/615216/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅加油。","img":"images/615216/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入羽衣甘蓝。","img":"images/615216/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加盐调味，炒熟后盛出。","img":"images/615216/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入黄油。","img":"images/615216/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"黄油化了以后，放入赤松茸，翻炒。","img":"images/615216/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"赤松茸变软后，倒入炒好的羽衣甘蓝，混合均匀。","img":"images/615216/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后放入熟松子仁，炒熟。","img":"images/615216/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"将炒好的蔬菜松茸倒入煮好的米饭中，拌匀。","img":"images/615216/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"着急吃，都拍模糊了😄。","img":"images/615216/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}